// jCodeMunch's per-project configuration, read from the repository root and overlaid on the
// global `~/.code-index/config.jsonc` per key at read time rather than merged at load. Declare a
// key here in full: whether a project array concatenates with the global one or replaces it is
// documented nowhere, so the list below is the whole list and not an addition to one.
{
  "extra_ignore_patterns": ["**/.claude/worktrees/**"],
}
